" title=\"Lay Bare Their Weakness\">Lay Bare Their Weakness</a></dt><dd>After dealing damage with an unarmed attack, the wearer gains a +1 bonus to their <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Save DC\">spell save DC</a> until the end of their turn.</dd></dl>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Person\">Person</span></h2>\n<p>The equipment set is named after <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Kushigo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kushigo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Kushigo\">Kushigo</a></span>, a legendary monk as described in the text of <a href=\"/wiki/Garb_of_the_Land_and_Sky\" title=\"Garb of the Land and Sky\">Garb of the Land and Sky</a>:\n</p>\n<center class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<table style=\"background: none;\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: top;\">“\n</td>\n<td><blockquote style=\"margin: 0; font-style: italic\">\n<p>Long ago, Kushigo was a warrior. Bedecked in an enormous set of plate steel, its shoulder pauldrons fashioned like great antlered stags, his arrival on a battlefield spelled doom for the enemy.\n</p>\nYet this armour - so light and fine - speaks nothing to the legacy.</blockquote>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: bottom;\">„\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 438px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 436px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Kushigo_Concept_Art.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Kushigo Set Concept Art\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Kushigo_Concept_Art.png/654px-Kushigo_Concept_Art.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Kushigo_Concept_Art.png/982px-Kushigo_Concept_Art.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/a1/Kushigo_Concept_Art.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Kushigo Set Concept Art\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Kushigo_Concept_Art.png/654px-Kushigo_Concept_Art.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"436\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Kushigo_Concept_Art.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Kushigo Set Concept Art</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Kushigo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kushigo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"